  <item>
    <title>去韩国不旅游，去过日子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa130c99d32647781668b3d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa130c99d32647781668b3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 10:16:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期聊韩国旅游——但不是你想的那种。</span></p><p><span>我们只是想聊聊，韩国真正的生活到底是什么？如果你迟迟没有选择去韩国，卡住你的到底是现实，还是想象？</span></p><p><span>总之，如果你也想试试“换个活法”的旅行，这期是给你的。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 环游世界但没去过韩国的人和去过韩国20多次的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 跟着韩剧去韩国是可以的吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 第一次的韩国旅行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> 反复去韩国的理由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 中国人一定要去韩国旅行的理由是？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 重新看待韩国人对咖啡的喜爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> 韩国审美融入生活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 聊聊韩国的「精致」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 在韩国享受生活？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 在韩国做一只幸福的宠物狗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 最打动人的还是人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 韩国没有好吃的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> 第一次去首尔的小攻略</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> 第二站：釜山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 第三站：江陵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 买水还是买烧酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> 「神奇」垃圾分类</span></p><p></p><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea