  <item>
    <title>格鲁吉亚：一个坐在石头沙滩上的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9a54c3f03e74ee6b04ebfe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9a54c3f03e74ee6b04ebfe</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 05:23:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，我从格鲁吉亚回来啦！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">00:03:02</a> 从第比利斯的酒店讲起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">00:08:50</a> 第比利斯的硫磺温泉、涂鸦、阳台</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">00:10:12</a> 梅丹集市和旱桥市场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> 国家博物馆和编年体纪念碑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">00:16:12</a> 一个有女王的地方，会让女人们过的更好吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">00:19:37</a> “让眼泪只在切洋葱时流下 ”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">00:23:04</a> Ali和nino的故乡巴统</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">00:28:49</a> 该谁举着“金羊毛”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">00:31:46</a> 格鲁吉亚拉斯维加斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">00:34:00</a> 梅斯蒂亚和乌树故里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">00:38:45</a> 一个没有信仰的人怎么逛格鲁吉亚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">00:44:00</a> 实名反对「格鲁吉亚人冷漠」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">00:52:08</a> 如果你爱狗，你就会爱格鲁吉亚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3519">00:58:39</a> 插播一则格鲁吉亚美食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3758">01:02:38</a> 格鲁吉亚：一个躺在石头沙滩上的人</span></p><p></p><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005"><span>@赵大晴</span></a></p><p><span>听友群：Echo888ing</span></p><p><span>「找到节目」</span></p><p><span>你可以在苹果播客、小宇宙、QQ音乐、网易云音乐找到节目，希望喜欢</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
