  <item>
    <title>独自环游世界的女孩，决定当妈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0e9a871b7bd5029590c66c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0e9a871b7bd5029590c66c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 05:56:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>kun'kun是我在旅行中认识的朋友，认识她是十五年前，那时我和她都「只」独自旅行，可以偶然相遇，但绝不接受和一个人全程绑定。</span></p><p><span>当然，她和我一样，也因为独自旅行遇到过大大小小的危险，但我们从不逃，从不因为一次危险放弃自由。</span></p><p><span>只是十五年后，我的女儿六岁，她的儿子四岁，我们某种程度都被孩子绑住了手脚。</span></p><p><span>但，我们也是自愿交出了手脚。</span></p><p><span>本期语速建议0.8倍收听👂👂</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">00:01:48</a> 十五年前我们在丽江的青旅遇见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">00:04:00</a> 坐皮卡、道路救援车、大铲车去拉萨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">00:09:02</a> 重回雨崩，旧藏宅变酒店，以前的穷学生也变成了“大哥大姐”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">00:13:00</a> 色达的车祸和不需要尖叫的伤痛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">00:15:12</a> 西昌的抢劫和见义勇为的大哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">00:17:32</a> 所以勇猛的、独自旅行的女孩当妈，正常吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">00:20:03</a> 加拿大老太太的精神支柱论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">00:23:19</a> 当曾经的独立女性变成了我妈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">00:24:55</a> 所以到底什么可以成为我们的支柱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">00:29:06</a> 成为“男宝妈”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">00:31:14</a> 只是支柱产生容易，维持难</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">00:35:13</a> 插入一段肤浅且快乐的澳大利亚行政</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">00:39:08</a> 人不能一直困在困境里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2896">00:48:16</a> 绝对的独立是绝对的劳累，也是绝对的自由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3262">00:54:22</a> 可能你离开孩子，孩子反而会长成你</span></p><p></p><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005"><span>@赵大晴</span></a></p><p><span>「找到嘉宾」</span></p><p><span>小红书 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a0fa192e8ac2b17762a66c1?xsec_token=YBCQFnCP_hMWZdiwhvH38jEcWYO3TjMWpxMfyZAqQyzHA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5a0fa192e8ac2b17762a66c1&amp;apptime=1779344774&amp;share_id=184fec2e96034bc1a9552fc6bdba4f03" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a0fa192e8ac2b17762a66c1?xsec_token=YBCQFnCP_hMWZdiwhvH38jEcWYO3TjMWpxMfyZAqQyzHA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5a0fa192e8ac2b17762a66c1&amp;apptime=1779344774&amp;share_id=184fec2e96034bc1a9552fc6bdba4f03"><span>@大K</span></a></p><p><span>听友群：Echo888ing</span></p><p><span>「找到节目」</span></p><p><span>你可以在苹果播客、小宇宙、QQ音乐、网易云音乐找到节目，希望喜欢</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
