    <title>巴西免签：安全的反面是自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69808d44b4be4c149b9f7017</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69808d44b4be4c149b9f7017</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Feb 2026 12:00:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近巴西宣布即将对中国免签，虽然虽然，目前看是「已官宣未生效」的状态，但看到社交媒体上大家的期待程度，我立刻决定，蹭个热点哈哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>我18年赶狂欢节去了巴西，一个人玩了一个月后立刻把巴西封为我的精神家园</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾则是我的沙发主，一个已经在战战兢兢的巴西居住了十年的中国女生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅行和居住，危险与快乐，都在这期播客里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你喜欢，也希望你早日踏上这片神奇的土地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 关于巴西签证的过去和现在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 巴西欢迎你买房，但不要炒房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 十年前丢的手机..找到了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 从被洗劫一空的青年旅舍开始聊聊巴西的安全状况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a> 一些保底型旅行安全建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a> 最好的还是巴西人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a> 第一次去巴西的旅行从圣保罗开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 我爱里约也爱狂欢节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">60:01</a> 你怕里约的贫民窟，他们也怕你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3607">60:07</a> 二月的伊瓜苏值得一去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4261">71:01</a> 萨尔瓦多的海滩和移动DJ大卡车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4267">71:07</a> 亚马逊雨林</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=