    <title>闲鱼流水六位数，人生进度加载中</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69155978cbba038b42524607</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69155978cbba038b42524607</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Nov 2025 04:11:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好，这次我带着我的“闲鱼人生”来了</span></p><p><span>从囤积物品到无限流转，到今年，二手买卖已经是我完全无法剔除的生活方式</span></p><p><span>本期节目既有一些买卖干货，也带着一些自我反省，但归根到底：</span></p><p><span>one mans trash, thats another mans come up</span></p><p><span>好东西值得被买/卖第二次</span></p><p><span>⚠️本期节目非广告</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 九年闲鱼用户的爱与恨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 断舍离的第一步是数数</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 从闲鱼卖货到感受品牌动向（帮助炒股）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 用不坏的家居和宜家打折货仓</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 愿意囤货的二手贩子就是好贩子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 闲鱼卖家生涯三大雷：logo在侧腰的lulu瑜伽裤，被扣坏的腰带，和无法抗拒的闲鱼拒收</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> 辨别买家四大招：芝麻信用、卖家评价、买卖物品、专柜验货</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> 五百块，我的情绪价格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 一个“破烂”摇摇车的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 越买越不在乎买，越卖越爱买</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 买二手最重要找到“真人”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 我在闲鱼交朋友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2845">47:25</a> 一本来自1920年的爱情诗集</span></p><p></p><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005"><span>@赵大晴</span></a></p><p><span>听友群：justminihao</span></p><p><span>「找到节目」</span></p><p><span>你可以在苹果播客、小宇宙、QQ音乐、网易云音乐找到节目，希望喜欢</span></p>]]></description>
