  <item>
    <title>儿童游乐园：都市母亲修罗场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68db991bae9d1455fbb2b4ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68db991bae9d1455fbb2b4ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 08:55:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑假结束了，流连在儿童游乐场的我身心俱疲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>孩子快乐和自己快乐真的可以达成平衡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由和安全真的可以同时存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个世上真的有不被欺负也不欺负别人，不成为石头也不做鸡蛋的成长故事吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我没有答案，这期播客也没有答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 游乐园冲突之一： 你会如何拒绝不喜欢的小朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> &nbsp;游乐园冲突之二：危险的充气城堡和突然出现的暴力男孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> &nbsp;游乐园冲突之三：泰国游乐园里的插队小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;游乐园冲突之四：打进医院的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 我的冲突评估方法：受伤情况、人数和监控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 从旁观者的角度：你想要面对怎样的世界？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 从“施暴者”的角度：如何不让情绪变成暴力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 从“受害者”的角度：危险真的可以避免么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 从家长的角度：只有我真的在场过，我才能放心离开</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005"><span>@赵大晴</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：justminihao</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找到节目」</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在苹果播客、小宇宙、QQ音乐、网易云音乐找到节目，希望喜欢</span></p>]]></description>
