    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Mar 2025 04:28:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我带着日本旅行攻略回来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期我们聊大阪旅行，也聊外表正经内心「混乱」的日本人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 日本行前tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 最不「日本」的城市大阪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 试试落地大阪先去奥莱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 日本交通不慌指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a> 酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 「迷惑」就是日本爱集体的写照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 大阪购物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 我爱扭蛋！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> 「低配」通天阁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 橘子街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">40:41</a> 中之岛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 儿童博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> 环球影城</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找到主播」</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1810136781"><span>@赵大晴就是我呀</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e5a650400000000010097ea?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e5a650400000000010097ea&amp;apptime=1709439005"><span>@赵大晴</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：justminihao</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找到节目」</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在苹果播客、小宇宙、QQ音乐、网易云音乐找到